==================================================
13. PERFORMANCE
==================================================

The redesign must not make the Dashboard noticeably heavier.

Avoid unnecessary:

- dependencies
- large images
- complex animation libraries
- expensive renders
- duplicated data fetching

Prefer existing icons and assets.

Use lazy loading only where it actually improves performance.

==================================================
14. IMPORTANT PRODUCT PRINCIPLE
==================================================

Do not try to show everything the application can do.

The Dashboard is NOT a feature catalog.

It is the student's starting point.

The user should open MahirVerse and immediately understand:

WHERE AM I?
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
WHAT SHOULD I DO NEXT?

Everything else is secondary.

