STEP 8
Run:

- lint
- tests
- production build

Fix all introduced issues.

Do not stop after the UI "looks good".

Verify that the Dashboard still functions correctly.

==================================================
16. QUALITY BAR
==================================================

Before considering this complete, ask:

"If I saw this app for the first time, would I immediately understand what I should do?"

"If I use this every day for 6 months, would this interface remain comfortable?"

"Does the design feel premium without trying too hard?"

"Does it feel like MahirVerse rather than a Tailwind template?"

"Is every visible element earning its space?"

"Does mobile feel as intentionally designed as desktop?"

"Does the Dashboard reduce cognitive load rather than add to it?"

If the answer is no, refine the design.

